  "uuid": "84eb380c-337d-4fdd-99d8-b5d75089a0a7",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "575f031e-1a62-f18d-3a7a-75b3e81179cf",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "5793b425-edaf-f5a1-24a5-988a8f294842",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Sarah Bowen Savant is a cultural historian specialising in early Islam, the study of religion, historiography, late antique Iran and Iraq and prophetic biography. She is also the Principle Investigator of ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "KITAB",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "http://kitab-project.org/?fbclid=IwAR3gcVlLODx-_SPvi1PcYk2TRbLxCI42J1FAXx6XR8-5t-Y04ZrnBpPUZJE",
                        "uuid": null,
                        "anchor": null,
                        "custom": {},
                        "target": "_blank",
                        "linktype": "url"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": " Project.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Professor Savant  received her MA from the University of Chicago and her PhD from Harvard University. Prior to joining AKU-ISMC in 2007, she was a Sultan Post-Doctoral Fellow at the University of California, Berkeley. She is the author of ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "The New Muslims of Post-Conquest Iran: Tradition, Memory, and Conversion ",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "italic"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "(Cambridge: Cambridge University Press, 2013), which won the Saidi-Sirjani Book Award, given by the International Society for Iranian Studies on behalf of the Persian Heritage Foundation. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "For further information about Professor Savant, please click ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "here",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "https://www.aku.edu/ismc/faculty/pages/profile.aspx?ProfileID=1&Name=Sarah Bowen Savant",
                        "uuid": null,
                        "anchor": null,
                        "custom": {},
                        "target": "_blank",
                        "linktype": "url"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": ".",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
